  "implementation": [
    "Use GameSaveService with a fixed manual/autosave slot catalog, validate and migrate each envelope and keep bad records isolated.",
    "Prepare story, original HYA assets and audio state in a detached scene. Publish the ready state together and retire the last scene only after a successful switch.",
    "Save chapter history with the slot. Save reading preferences, global read markers and unlocked replay entries separately.",
    "Replay the recorded route and action results in a new presentation. The original save session, host rewards, actions and autosave remain isolated from replay."
  ],
